! zwm default theme for xterm (matches the design mockup). Loaded by zwm-session
! before ~/.Xresources, so anything you set there wins.
XTerm*faceName: JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono
XTerm*faceSize: 10
XTerm*renderFont: true
XTerm*background: #242933
XTerm*foreground: #d8dee9
XTerm*cursorColor: #88c0d0
XTerm*pointerColor: #d8dee9
XTerm*pointerColorBackground: #242933
XTerm*internalBorder: 14
XTerm*borderWidth: 0
XTerm*scrollBar: false
XTerm*saveLines: 10000
XTerm*boldColors: false
XTerm*color0: #3b4252
XTerm*color8: #4c566a
XTerm*color1: #bf616a
XTerm*color9: #bf616a
XTerm*color2: #a3be8c
XTerm*color10: #a3be8c
XTerm*color3: #ebcb8b
XTerm*color11: #ebcb8b
XTerm*color4: #81a1c1
XTerm*color12: #81a1c1
XTerm*color5: #b48ead
XTerm*color13: #b48ead
XTerm*color6: #88c0d0
XTerm*color14: #8fbcbb
XTerm*color7: #e5e9f0
XTerm*color15: #eceff4
